cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Soybean Yield and Climate Variability in Illinois, 1980-2025
message: If you use this dataset or pipeline, please cite it.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Perry
    given-names: Oric
abstract: >-
  County-level panel analysis of the association between climate variability and
  soybean yield across 102 Illinois counties, 1980-2025, with Champaign County as
  the focal unit. Combines USDA NASS Quick Stats production data with NOAA NCEI
  nClimDiv county monthly climate. Includes panel fixed-effects models, machine
  learning under strict temporal validation, county climate-sensitivity ranking,
  and climate perturbation sensitivity experiments.
keywords:
  - agriculture
  - climate
  - soybean
  - panel data
  - Illinois
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-08-31
